(text "ESR <=30R; initial +/-10ppm; -40 to +85C, stability +/-20ppm.\n20pF each gives CL=12pF with estimated 2pF combined stray.\nRetain R571=22R and R570=1MR per Rockchip HW Guide." (at 198.12 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d3d0be2b-afc3-5500-8a65-3f74e7339fe8"))
(rectangle (start 15.24 198.12) (end 406.40000000000003 248.92000000000002) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default) (color 60 110 145 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "35ab4008-34a9-5d3b-8568-7ee7b6a5fad0"))
(text "Layout and bring-up requirements" (at 19.05 201.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "84ede76e-8a66-5231-a6da-3176d57bac3b"))
(text "Place Y570, R570/R571 and C570/C571 beside U1 AF27/AF28; keep clock copper short, on one layer and away from switch nodes.\nGround the crystal case pins 2/4 locally; use a quiet ground reference and avoid unrelated traces beneath the oscillator loop.\nMeasure startup margin, frequency and drive across supply/temperature. Treat the listed 100uW crystal drive as a conservative ceiling.\nLoad capacitors require tuning after PCB parasitics are known. CLK32K_IN remains unused; configure the internal PVTM low-speed clock." (at 22.86 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "73ca6bdc-44eb-516f-9cc9-c1805716a29f"))
(text "Sources: Rockchip RK3568 HW Guide V1.2, clock section 2.2.2.3; tablet reference p13; Yajingxin exact-MPN datasheet p1.\nThis page captures the processor oscillator. Complete board integration, routing and release validation remain unfinished." (at 20.32 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ac9bd12c-c71e-5b22-9b57-1a38861a07be"))
)
